    {
      "id": "claim_7514e804e983455ab520f434eb1ef9a6",
      "statement": "block_integrity is deliberately excluded from the screen because image and table blocks legitimately carry no text, so an illustrated document has a low ratio by construction; using it would route essentially every illustrated document to light, and a regression test asserts an image-rich low-block-integrity document is not classified as degraded.",
      "evidence": [
        {
