    {
      "id": "claim_0ba00539bd104aacb2c1978f6b53dcf7",
      "statement": "Because not_evaluated criteria form the coverage denominator, a light-route document's coverage collapses and typically raises the low_coverage flag, which is how the routing decision surfaces quantitatively in the report.",
