    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fff8ccc444b94c24b5a3aad3351b4c31",
      "statement": "screen_document is pure and side-effect-free — it takes a ParsedDoc and the metrics dict and returns only a route and its reasons — with flag attachment left to the run orchestration and LLM skipping left to the judge's skip_llm argument, which is why the rules are testable in isolation with a synthetic metrics dict.",
